# Parquet files: ignore large/temporary parquets, keep oracle ground truth in jobs/
# Parquet 文件: 忽略大体积临时数据，保留 jobs/ 目录下的基准对账标准答案
*.parquet
!jobs/**/*.parquet

# Delta Lake transaction logs / Delta Lake 事务日志
_delta_log/

# Temporary scratch files / 临时暂存文件
*.tmp
spec_dump.txt

# Migration engine outputs and local settings / 迁移引擎输出与本地设置
out/
spark-warehouse/

# Results of running the engine: regenerate with `python -m engine run-all` then `python -m engine export`.
# 引擎的执行结果:用 `python -m engine run-all` 再 `python -m engine export` 重新产生。
ui/mock_data/
jobs/*/solution.py
jobs/*/oracle_output.parquet
jobs/approvals.json
# The CI fixture is hand-written, not an engine result. / CI 样板是手写的,不是引擎产出。
!jobs/J00_mock/solution.py
!jobs/J00_mock/oracle_output.parquet

